            </div>


            <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <h4>Backend Development</h4>

                    <p>
                        Working with servers, APIs, databases, and application logic.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <h4>Exploring Technology</h4>

                    <p>
                        Continuously learning new technologies and exploring areas
                        such as machine learning.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

